  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: heap buffer overflow in three-way merge\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-105437.patch: use size_t and st_add*() for\n       the merge buffer size computations in xdiff/xmerge.c, add st_add5()\n       to git-compat-util.h.\n     - CVE-2026-105437\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: over-long cache entry names truncated to .git\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-111760.patch: reject cache entries with\n       over-long names and add index.maxPathLen in read-cache.c, config.c,\n       environment.c, cache.h, use size_t and st_add() in tree.c and\n       builtin/checkout.c, add tests in t/t1600-index.sh.\n     - CVE-2026-111760\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: fast-import arbitrary file write via export-pack-edges\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-114466.patch: forbid the export-pack-edges\n       option in the input stream without --allow-unsafe-features in\n       fast-import.c, add tests in t/t9300-fast-import.sh.\n     - CVE-2026-114466",
